## Open evidence limits

- AC-4 remains failed; the accepted run has 753/6,049 EOF intervals above 60 ms.
- GDB feasibility was proven only for a disposable same-UID Python process; the host ptrace sysctl files were unavailable and one stack ended with an unwind warning.
- Any future GDB sampling pauses FFmpeg threads and perturbs the triggering intervals; no causal claim follows from the snapshots alone.
- Futex wait/wake evidence does not identify the awakened TID or prove causality. DQBUF counted 602 calls for 600 outputs without sequence fields, so exact dequeue-to-output identity remains unproven.
- AC-6 reconnect/sibling continuity and AC-8 four-camera soak remain hardware deferrals; the minor FFmpeg child resource-limit finding remains open.

